# Shared build context for all root-context Dockerfiles (root Dockerfile =
# agent/worker, build/pinard-backend, build/pinard-solo, build/pinard-webterm-gateway
# all build with context "."). Keep it lean but wide enough for the worker
# image's `dist/build.sh` run (needs bin/, dist/build.sh + dist/.makeself,
# deps/babysitter, lib/, pi-extension/, themes/, processes/, scripts/).
.git
.worktrees
node_modules
**/node_modules
website/public
website/resources
website/.hugo_build.lock
dist/pinard-linux-x64.run
dist/singularity
dist/stage
releases
tests
charts
docs
openspec
*.run
*.sif
.engram
.pi
.claude
logs
